# CODEOWNERS — review ownership for NeuroPause
#
# Each line maps a path to the owner(s) who must approve changes to it.
# Order matters: the LAST matching pattern wins. See
# https://docs.github.com/repositories/managing-your-repositories-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PLACEHOLDER HANDLES — READ BEFORE USE
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Every @neuropause/* handle below is a PLACEHOLDER. No such GitHub teams are
# guaranteed to exist yet, and this file names NO individuals. Repo
# administrators MUST replace each placeholder with a real team slug or
# @username before code-owner review is enforced; an unresolvable owner
# silently disables enforcement for that path. Mapping of roles is described in
# GOVERNANCE.md.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

